  "thag1.7:0.4": "1. 1. 7. sītavaniyattheragāthā. ",
  "thag1.7:1.1": "yopānudī maccurājassa senaṃ ",
  "thag1.7:1.2": "naḷasetuṃ va sudubbalaṃ mahogho ",
  "thag1.7:1.3": "vijitāvī apetabheravo hi ",
  "thag1.7:1.4": "danto so parinibbuto ṭhitatto’ti. ",
  "thag1.7:1.5": "itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā bhalliyo thero gāthaṃ abhāsitthā’ti. "
}
